{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgkd4JRXQYv2UXcTvbfpJ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0154MKjectZK1DbibsskaYZ8","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"answer":"I'd open the account at פסגות and buy \"אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125\". The page says that leaves about 86,045 ₪ after 10 years, starting from 10,000 ₪ and adding 500 ₪ a month. Those are the page's default amounts, not my own.","confidence":"fairly sure","gave_up":false,"stuck":[{"where":"Screen 1, the amount fields","why":"The task doesn't give amounts. The fields were already set to 10,000 and 500, so I left them as they were and used those, even though I actually have 30,000."},{"where":"Screen 7–8, the fund list","why":"Every fund has a minus percent under it ('-0.04%', '-0.37%'...), and next to the others it says '-1,030 ₪'. My first thought was that all these funds lose money. I only went on because the chosen one has the smallest minus."},{"where":"Screen 3, the account card","why":"פסגות isn't one of the big banks I know from ads. I hesitated for a second, but it's marked 'הזול' with a star, and Leumi only leaves about 3,000 less."}],"used":["Heading 'איפה ואיך הכי זול להשקיע במדד'","Index button 'ת\"א-125' (already selected)","Fields 'סכום היום' 10,000, 'הפקדה חודשית' 500, 'תשואה בשנה' 7%","'הפקדתם 70,000 ₪'","Card 'הבחירה שלכם · הזול' 86,045 ₪, next one 85,015 ₪","Account name פסגות ניירות ערך בע\"מ, 1,049 ₪ over 10 years","Account ranking list: פסגות 86,045, לאומי 82,968, ...","Fund card 'אי.בי.אי. מחקה (4A) ת\"א 125', 'דמי ניהול 0.1%'","Fund list with '-1,030 ₪' etc."],"skimmed":["The cost bar with colours (pink 5,555, I guessed tax because of the legend 'מס')","'העלות אצלכם לעומת הזוג השני' (18 more, 1,390 less, 342 more)","The 'לא בחישוב' notes about other prices for young people/soldiers","The bottom of the account list (Altshuler, Excellence, Meitav, Interactive)","The 'what changes the most' chart with lines and the table '12 שנים 18,905 ₪ יותר'"],"skipped":["The grey paragraph above the account list about prices","The 'מול המדד' explanation paragraph under the fund list","Fold arrows on each bank row","'אינפלציה' button","'קיבלתם מחיר אחר? הזינו אותו' link","'הוספת קרן שלא ברשימה'","Screens 10–13"],"unsure_meaning":["דמי משמרת","נאמן 0.025%","'-0.04% בשנה · שנה אחת' (I read it as the fund losing a little)","'-1,030 ₪' next to the other funds (I think it means less than mine, but it looks like a loss)","(4A), the number 5112628","קרן מחקה vs קרן סל (I thought they're the same)","'העמלות זו על זו' in the legend","'בכסף של היום'"],"not_found":["What to actually do first, like how to open the account at פסגות","Any line for my own 30,000 without moving the fields"],"findings":[{"what":"Every fund shows a red-looking minus percent and a minus shekel amount. To me it looks like all of them lose money, and that almost scared me off.","where":"Fund list, screens 7–8"},{"what":"The first big number is 70,000 'הפקדתם', but the defaults (10,000 + 500) aren't my amounts, and nothing tells me to change them first.","where":"Screens 1–2"},{"what":"The colour bars have a legend far away, so I had to guess which colour is which.","where":"Screen 2–3 cost bar"},{"what":"The cheapest account is a name I know less than the banks, and nothing on the card says why it's safe.","where":"Account card פסגות"},{"what":"Lots of words like נאמן, דמי משמרת, 4A with no plain explanation next to them.","where":"Fund card, legend"},{"what":"The page is very long, and after the fund list I would have closed it. The chart with the stair lines is too much.","where":"Screen 9 onward"}]},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3735,"cache_read_input_tokens":17396,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3735},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard",